## Description

I had Claude Fable design my vacation plans and I'm stunned!

For this itinerary, fable max was required. But the result did not disappoint. Fable not only gave me a detailed list of stops, it created a custom packing list for each member on the trip, as well as a newspaper with activities to distribute throughout.

This is one of those pet projects that you can't stop marveling over how cool it really is. 

